WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.430
Your customers ask you the same question every week.

2
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.410
How does a heat pump work at 10 below?

3
00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.348
What happens without a will?

4
00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:09.386
You explain it…

5
00:00:09.386 --> 00:00:10.493
again and again.

6
00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:13.883
I'm Cass, an animator in the Flathead Valley.

7
00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:15.450
I turn that one question

8
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.279
into a short animated video,

9
00:00:17.279 --> 00:00:18.650
in your brand colors.

10
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.332
Send me your website and the question.

11
00:00:21.332 --> 00:00:23.675
I study how you talk, write the script,

12
00:00:23.675 --> 00:00:26.077
and animate it, with captions and sound.

13
00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:30.033
The first 15 seconds are free. Keep it. Post it.

14
00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:30.837
No strings.

15
00:00:31.237 --> 00:00:34.557
Want the full version? It's $156,

16
00:00:34.557 --> 00:00:35.965
or 3 for $390.

17
00:00:36.415 --> 00:00:39.497
Get your free sample at cassrices.com!
